<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('partials/head') %>
</head>
<body class="bg-white text-brand-text">
  <%- include('partials/header') %>

  <section class="py-10 sm:py-16 bg-brand-offwhite border-b border-brand-border">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 text-center">
      <h1 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-2">Terms, Conditions & Policies</h1>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-brand-muted">City Line Tours And Travels • Srinagar, Kashmir</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-10 sm:py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-6 sm:space-y-12 text-xs sm:text-sm text-brand-muted leading-relaxed">
      
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-3">1. Privacy Policy</h2>
        <p class="mb-2">
          At City Line Tours And Travels, we respect your privacy. Any personal information submitted through our website forms (including your name, telephone number, email address, and travel dates) is gathered strictly for the purpose of communicating with you, generating your requested travel quotation, and coordinating your travel arrangements.
        </p>
        <p>
          We never sell, rent, or lease your personal information to third parties or unsolicited marketers.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-3">2. Booking & Enquiry Terms</h2>
        <p class="mb-2">
          Submitting an enquiry via our website does not constitute a confirmed financial booking. Once our travel team receives your enquiry, we will communicate directly with you to finalize hotel categories, vehicle availability, and exact quotation.
        </p>
        <p>
          Bookings are confirmed upon receipt of advance token deposit as agreed in your written travel proposal.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-3">3. Cancellation & Refund Policy</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5">
          <li>Cancellations requested 30 days or more prior to arrival date: Full refund minus processing fees.</li>
          <li>Cancellations requested 15 to 29 days prior to arrival date: 50% retention of total package cost.</li>
          <li>Cancellations requested less than 14 days prior to arrival date: Non-refundable due to pre-committed hotel and vehicle reservations.</li>
          <li>In unforeseen situations such as natural calamities or severe highway road blockages, City Line Tours will make best efforts to reschedule dates or offer alternative routes with minimal customer disruption.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-3">4. Contact Information</h2>
        <p>
          For any clarifications regarding our policies, please contact our support desk at <a href="mailto:<%= settings.email %>" class="text-brand-blue font-semibold"><%= settings.email %></a> or call <a href="tel:<%= settings.phone %>" class="text-brand-blue font-semibold"><%= settings.phone %></a>.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
  <%- include('partials/whatsapp') %>
  <%- include('partials/scripts') %>
</body>
</html>

